  "details": "1. You need 3 people. Join on the same world.\n2. \"Hide Avatar\" on one user. 1. Leave the other one alone (Our case had the user on \"Use Safety Settings\")\n3. Drop a portal to another world. All three enter the portal.\n4. When you load into the new world, the avatar-hidden user should still have their avatar hiding.\n5. Observe the not-hidden person as they locomote/move around.\n\nExpected:\nThe not-hidden person acts normally and has IK/locomotion animations.\n\nActual:\nThe not-hidden person is stuck in an idle pose and slides around when locomoting. If they are in VR, they are still stuck in that pose.",
